why A second seducer demon, the male sayaad, and a soul shard bag to carry your shards.

# The incubus for Alliance warlocks: Devourer of Souls (1716) from Gakin
# the Darkbinder to Takar the Seer in the Barrens, What Is Love? (65602, the
# Wooden Figurine in Ashenvale) and The Binding (65603) back in the
# Slaughtered Lamb.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0
# and Questie-Forever) for the givers, the figurine and the summoning circle;
# Forever's Warlock class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): Forever gives the chain
# level 20 and lists a Small Soul Pouch as The Binding's reward. Forever's
# data does not list the spell; in Classic it is Summon Incubus (Wowpedia,
# "The Binding (Incubus, Stormwind)"), and Wowpedia ("Incubus (warlock
# minion)") describes the incubus as the male sayaad, the succubus's
# counterpart. Wowpedia is Classic-only: neither point is confirmed in Forever.
# The leveling guides teach the succubus from the same Devourer of Souls
# (Heartswood 1738, The Binding 1739: 04-redridge-mountains,
# 07-thousand-needles, 30-40/02-desolace, 30-40/05-arathi-highlands). Takar
# offers What Is Love? beside Heartswood, so a warlock on that route can take
# both; the accept and turn-in below tick off if you already have them.

step Devourer of Souls
  tip At 20 Gakin the Darkbinder, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Takar the Seer in the Barrens.
  level 20
  accept 1716                         -- Gakin the Darkbinder

step Takar the Seer
  zone The Barrens
  tip Takar the Seer camps in the southern Barrens, east of the road north-east of Camp Taurajo: come in from the east and keep clear of the Horde guards.
  turnin 1716                         -- Takar the Seer
  accept 65602

step Wooden Figurine
  zone Ashenvale
  tip From Astranaar take the road west to Maestra's Post: the figurine lies in a house among the trees north of the post.
  collect 190309 quest 65602.1        -- Wooden Figurine

step The Binding
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Back to Gakin in the Slaughtered Lamb. Place the figurine at the summoning circle in the crypt below him and defeat the incubus it calls.
  turnin 65602                        -- Gakin the Darkbinder
  accept 65603
  kill 185335 quest 65603.1           -- Summoned Incubus
  turnin 65603                        -- Gakin the Darkbinder: he binds the incubus to you
